#subtitle: International relations and dealing with the DDR.

= Foreign Policy

What should our foreign policy priority be?

@fp_menu

- @improve_europe
- @improve_usa
- @improve_east
- @root: Do not enact any policies for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@improve_europe
title: Improve our relations with our European allies.
on-arrival: europe_relation += 2

The key to peace in Europe is a rapproachment between the allies and Germany. Therefore, we are continuing to improve relations with the rest of Europe.

@improve_usa
title: Improve our relations with the United States.
on-arrival: usa_relation += 2

We aim to improve relations with the United States of America.

@improve_east
title: Improve our relations with our eastern neighbors.
on-arrival: east_relation += 1; east_relation += 1 if in_grand_coalition == 0

We aim to improve relations with the DDR and the rest of the eastern block. Hopefully we can convince them of our peaceful intentions. [? if in_grand_coalition : The <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span> and <span style="color: #286fe0;">**CSU**</span> support the Hallstein doctrine and will sabotage our efforts. ?]

Fascist Italy remains a problem, and the Soviet Union also lies outside the system. But for now, there is new hope for peace and prosperity throughout the continent.
